<p>Dear <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Welcome to Mezzanine. Here’s a short guide so your first visit goes smoothly.
</p>

<h3 style="margin: 24px 0 8px; font-size: 16px;">Where we are</h3>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px;">
  Rua Brito e Cunha, 27, R/C<br>
  4450-085 Matosinhos<br>
  <%= link_to "View on Google Maps", "https://maps.app.goo.gl/zp8jWX9CJJjjR9ye7" %>
</p>

<% if @booking&.seat.present? %>
  <h3 style="margin: 24px 0 8px; font-size: 16px;">Your <%= @booking.seat.meeting_room? ? "room" : "desk" %></h3>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 12px;">
    <strong><%= @booking.seat.label %></strong><br>
    <%= @booking.period_label %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<h3 style="margin: 24px 0 8px; font-size: 16px;">Access</h3>
<ul style="margin: 0 0 12px; padding-left: 18px; line-height: 1.6;">
  <li>Space hours: <strong>08:00–20:00</strong></li>
  <% if @access_code&.synced_to_lock? %>
    <li>The door code is: <strong style="letter-spacing: 0.08em;">*<%= @access_code.code %># - (Also available in your account on the my bookings page)</strong></li>
  <% else %>
    <li>Your door code will be available in your account on the my bookings page</li>
  <% end %>
  <li>Keep the door closed after you enter — don’t share your code</li>
  <li>Bookings and credits are managed from your account on the website</li>
</ul>

<h3 style="margin: 24px 0 8px; font-size: 16px;">House rules</h3>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px;">
  <%= image_tag attachments["house_rules1.png"].url, alt: "House rules", style: "display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: auto; margin: 0 0 12px;" %>
  <%= image_tag attachments["house_rules2.png"].url, alt: "House rules continued", style: "display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: auto;" %>
</p>

<h3 style="margin: 24px 0 8px; font-size: 16px;">Need help?</h3>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px;">
  Reply to this email or write to <%= mail_to "hello@mezzaninecowork.com" %>.
  We’re happy to help.
</p>

<p>
  Kind regards,<br>
  The Mezzanine team<br>
  Rua Brito e Cunha, 27 · Matosinhos<br>
  <%= mail_to "hello@mezzaninecowork.com" %><br>
  Follow us on <%= link_to "Instagram", "https://www.instagram.com/mezzanine.cowork/" %>
</p>
